      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOTCH LASS (2) turned in a better effort at Taree Super Track last start, finishing second behind Ivy Star (17.80) in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. One of the contenders. DAPHNE ZACAPA (4) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 5 lengths from the winner (23.26). Has a good record here at this journey. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Can measure up this time. ASTON MENDES (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (19.85) last time in a Grade 5 at Bulli. Must be included in calculations. SHANGHAI SPY (6) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
